{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type AngularFormType<TOptions> = TOptions extends FormOptions<infer TFormData, infer TFormValidators, infer TSubmitReturn, unknown> ? InternalFormApi<TFormData, TFormValidators, AngularFormTypeSubmitReturn<TSubmitReturn>> : never;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/angular-form/src/form-type.ts#L57","children":[{"type":"text","value":"form-type.ts:57"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Derives the Angular form API type represented by a reusable options object."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use it to type inputs for components that belong to one known form shape.\nOptions such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmit"},{"type":"text","value":" can be defined either in the shared options or\nwhen the form is created in the component."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"toptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AnyFormOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The reusable form options from which the API derives its form data, validator, and submit-result types."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const profileOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n})\n\ntype ProfileForm = AngularFormType<typeof profileOptions>\n\nexport class NameFieldComponent {\n  form = input.required<ProfileForm>()\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"toptions","text":"TOptions","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype AngularFormType<TOptions> = TOptions extends FormOptions<infer TFormData, infer TFormValidators, infer TSubmitReturn, unknown> ? InternalFormApi<TFormData, TFormValidators, AngularFormTypeSubmitReturn<TSubmitReturn>> : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [form-type.ts:57](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/angular-form/src/form-type.ts#L57)\n\nDerives the Angular form API type represented by a reusable options object.\n\nUse it to type inputs for components that belong to one known form shape.\nOptions such as `onSubmit` can be defined either in the shared options or\nwhen the form is created in the component.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOptions\n\n`TOptions` *extends* `AnyFormOptions`\n\nThe reusable form options from which the API derives its form data, validator, and submit-result types.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst profileOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n})\n\ntype ProfileForm = AngularFormType<typeof profileOptions>\n\nexport class NameFieldComponent {\n  form = input.required<ProfileForm>()\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AngularFormType\ntitle: AngularFormType\n---\n\n```ts\ntype AngularFormType<TOptions> = TOptions extends FormOptions<infer TFormData, infer TFormValidators, infer TSubmitReturn, unknown> ? InternalFormApi<TFormData, TFormValidators, AngularFormTypeSubmitReturn<TSubmitReturn>> : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [form-type.ts:57](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/angular-form/src/form-type.ts#L57)\n\nDerives the Angular form API type represented by a reusable options object.\n\nUse it to type inputs for components that belong to one known form shape.\nOptions such as `onSubmit` can be defined either in the shared options or\nwhen the form is created in the component.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOptions\n\n`TOptions` *extends* `AnyFormOptions`\n\nThe reusable form options from which the API derives its form data, validator, and submit-result types.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst profileOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n})\n\ntype ProfileForm = AngularFormType<typeof profileOptions>\n\nexport class NameFieldComponent {\n  form = input.required<ProfileForm>()\n}\n```\n"}
